{"id":"ed85cd72838ef590","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-sharp-p-oracle.md","title":"df-sharp-p-oracle (Polynomial Time with","display":"df-sharp-p-oracle (Polynomial Time with","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-sharp-p-oracle (Polynomial Time with","label":"28-df-sharp-p-oracle","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-sharp-p-oracle","P^#P","Polynomial Time with #P Oracles"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-sharp-p]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-configuration]]","[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_book_location":"§17.3 function oracles and #P completeness; printed pp.345–346; PDF pp.371–372","source_printed_pages":"345–346","source_pdf_pages":"371–372","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sharp-p-oracle (Polynomial Time with"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-sharp-p-oracle"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-sharp-p-oracle</span><span>P^#P</span><span>Polynomial Time with #P Oracles</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9470641051e0a7af\" href=\"?note=9470641051e0a7af\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p\">28-df-sharp-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§17.3 function oracles and #P completeness; printed pp.345–346; PDF pp.371–372"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"345–346"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"371–372"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-sharp-p-oracle-(Polynomial-Time-with-#P-Oracles)\">df-sharp-p-oracle (Polynomial Time with #P Oracles)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f,g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(j)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(j)\\)</span> 是整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>。字串坐标从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\uparrow\\notin\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\uparrow\\notin\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=k_M\">\\(k=k_M\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^0_{M,x}\">\\(C^0_{M,x}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}\">\\(\\operatorname{out}\\)</span> 依次见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O=(M,r,a,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{reply}})\">\\(O=(M,r,a,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{reply}})\\)</span> 是候选函数预言机描述；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,a\">\\(r,a\\)</span> 分别为查询带和应答带编号，工作带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 保留为输出带。在下列查询、应答、转移及运行公式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\in\\mathrm{FOTM}\">\\(O\\in\\mathrm{FOTM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_M,q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\">\\(Q_M,q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\)</span> 分别表示机器元组的状态集与两个停机状态分量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\">\\(C=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。下式定义的预言机应答转移替换查询状态上的普通转移，其余转移仍逐格执行。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathbf P\">\\(\\#\\mathbf P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"9470641051e0a7af\" href=\"?note=9470641051e0a7af\" title=\"28-df-sharp-p\">28-df-sharp-p</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span>，时间的上确界取于此有序集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O^g(x)\">\\(O^g(x)\\)</span> 为字符串输出或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\uparrow\">\\(\\uparrow\\)</span>，自然数输出使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTM}\\coloneqq\\{(M,r,a,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{reply}}):M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ r,a\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k_M\\},\\ r\\ne a,\\ q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{reply}}\\in Q_M\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\},\\ q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\ne q_{\\mathrm{reply}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FOTM}\\coloneqq\\{(M,r,a,q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{reply}}):M\\in\\mathrm{TM},\\ r,a\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k_M\\},\\ r\\ne a,\\ q_{\\mathrm{query}},q_{\\mathrm{reply}}\\in Q_M\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\},\\ q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\ne q_{\\mathrm{reply}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tape}(w)(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j&amp;0\\le j&lt;|w|,\\\\\\sqcup&amp;j\\ge|w|\\end{cases}\\qquad(w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ j\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tape}(w)(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}w_j&amp;0\\le j&lt;|w|,\\\\\\sqcup&amp;j\\ge|w|\\end{cases}\\qquad(w\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ j\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{out}(T_r),\\qquad w_{O,g,C}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}(g(\\operatorname{qry}_O(C))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qry}_O(C)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{out}(T_r),\\qquad w_{O,g,C}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}(g(\\operatorname{qry}_O(C))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T^{O,g,C}_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{tape}(w_{O,g,C})&amp;j=a,\\\\T_j&amp;j\\ne a,\\end{cases}\\qquad i^{O,g,C}_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;j=a,\\\\i_j&amp;j\\ne a\\end{cases}\\qquad(0\\le j\\le k_M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T^{O,g,C}_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{tape}(w_{O,g,C})&amp;j=a,\\\\T_j&amp;j\\ne a,\\end{cases}\\qquad i^{O,g,C}_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;j=a,\\\\i_j&amp;j\\ne a\\end{cases}\\qquad(0\\le j\\le k_M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{reply}_{O,g}(C)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle q_{\\mathrm{reply}},(T^{O,g,C}_j)_{j=0}^{k_M},(i^{O,g,C}_j)_{j=0}^{k_M}\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{reply}_{O,g}(C)\\coloneqq\\left\\langle q_{\\mathrm{reply}},(T^{O,g,C}_j)_{j=0}^{k_M},(i^{O,g,C}_j)_{j=0}^{k_M}\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_{O^g}(C,C&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow(q\\ne q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{Step}_M(C,C&#39;))\\lor(q=q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land C&#39;=\\operatorname{reply}_{O,g}(C))\\qquad(O\\in\\mathrm{FOTM}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Step}_{O^g}(C,C&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow(q\\ne q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land\\operatorname{Step}_M(C,C&#39;))\\lor(q=q_{\\mathrm{query}}\\land C&#39;=\\operatorname{reply}_{O,g}(C))\\qquad(O\\in\\mathrm{FOTM}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^g}(x)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\left\\{(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)^{m+1}:C_0=C^0_{M,x},\\ \\forall j&lt;m\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{O^g}(C_j,C_{j+1})\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^g}(x)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\left\\{(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)^{m+1}:C_0=C^0_{M,x},\\ \\forall j&lt;m\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{O^g}(C_j,C_{j+1})\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_{O^g}(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^g}(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{time}_{O^g}(x)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\exists(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^g}(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O^g(x)\\coloneqq\\iota y\\in\\Sigma^*\\cup\\{\\uparrow\\}\\;\\left[(y=\\uparrow\\land\\operatorname{time}_{O^g}(x)=\\infty)\\lor\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^g}(x)\\;\\exists q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\;\\left(C_m=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle\\land q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land y=\\operatorname{out}(T_1)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O^g(x)\\coloneqq\\iota y\\in\\Sigma^*\\cup\\{\\uparrow\\}\\;\\left[(y=\\uparrow\\land\\operatorname{time}_{O^g}(x)=\\infty)\\lor\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\operatorname{Comp}_{O^g}(x)\\;\\exists q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\;\\left(C_m=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle\\land q\\in\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}\\}\\land y=\\operatorname{out}(T_1)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi_L(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in L,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin L.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad\\chi_L(x)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;x\\in L,\\\\0&amp;x\\notin L.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\le_T^{\\mathbf P}g\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists O\\in\\mathrm{FOTM}\\;\\exists b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(O^g(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(f(x))\\land\\operatorname{time}_{O^g}(x)\\le c(|x|+1)^b\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\le_T^{\\mathbf P}g\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists O\\in\\mathrm{FOTM}\\;\\exists b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(O^g(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(f(x))\\land\\operatorname{time}_{O^g}(x)\\le c(|x|+1)^b\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\#\\mathbf P:\\forall f\\in\\#\\mathbf P\\;f\\le_T^{\\mathbf P}g\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T\\coloneqq\\{g\\in\\#\\mathbf P:\\forall f\\in\\#\\mathbf P\\;f\\le_T^{\\mathbf P}g\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^g\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists O\\in\\mathrm{FOTM}\\;\\exists b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(O^g(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(\\chi_L(x))\\land\\operatorname{time}_{O^g}(x)\\le c(|x|+1)^b\\bigr)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P^g\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists O\\in\\mathrm{FOTM}\\;\\exists b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(O^g(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(\\chi_L(x))\\land\\operatorname{time}_{O^g}(x)\\le c(|x|+1)^b\\bigr)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{g\\in\\#\\mathbf P}\\mathbf P^g.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf P^{\\#\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{g\\in\\#\\mathbf P}\\mathbf P^g.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>§17.3 将布尔语言 oracle 推广到字符串函数，并以多项式时间 Turing 归约定义计数完备性。计数答复用二进制表示，不能按一元整数展开；本节点使用的读写计时约定对 #P 答复与原书的 oracle 约定多项式等价。</p>\n<p>R7：内建语言特征函数的完整分段定义，补足非成员输出0和二元值域；函数 oracle 的归约、应答编码与计时约定未变。</p>\n<p>本次接口补全：函数预言机的描述集合、查询带解析、应答覆盖、后继关系、运行前缀、时间及输出现均在前两节给出。应答带与输出带分离，因而预言机不会在一步内替算法写完最终输出；准备查询、读取应答及写出结果由普通转移计时。确定性、总函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 和有限二进制应答保证每个非停机配置有唯一后继，停机输出的唯一描述因此良定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-sharp-p-oracle-(Polynomial-Time-with-#P-Oracles)","text":"df-sharp-p-oracle (Polynomial Time with #P Oracles)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Asserti