{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$，见 [[28-df-tm]]。$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$、$C^0_{M,x}$、$\\operatorname{out}$ 依次见 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$，见 [[28-df-tm]]。$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$、$C^0_{M,x}$、$\\operatorname{out}$ 依次见 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$，见 [[28-df-tm]]。$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$、$C^0_{M,x}$、$\\operatorname{out}$ 依次见 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$，见 [[28-df-tm]]。$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$、$C^0_{M,x}$、$\\operatorname{out}$ 依次见 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sharp-p","status":"resolved","id":"9470641051e0a7af","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\#\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-p]]。$\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\